1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,289
This is the Dermalogica Liquid Peelfoliant, a professional-grade at-home peel.

2
00:00:05,289 --> 00:00:10,355
In this review, we cover what is in it, what it does, and exactly how to use it.

3
00:00:11,055 --> 00:00:16,260
It is recommended for three concerns: dullness, fine lines and wrinkles, and pores.

4
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:21,825
The formula is a blend of thirty percent acids and enzymes, made to work at

5
00:00:21,825 --> 00:00:24,354
different layers of the skin's surface.

6
00:00:24,354 --> 00:00:29,802
The product page describes it as a daily peel with fifteen percent AHA, BHA and PHA,

7
00:00:29,802 --> 00:00:34,537
ten percent fruit enzymes, five percent phytic acid, and tranexamic acid.

8
00:00:35,367 --> 00:00:40,828
That blend includes glycolic acid and lactic acid, two alpha hydroxy acids.

9
00:00:41,528 --> 00:00:47,493
It also includes salicylic acid, a beta hydroxy acid, along with phytic acid and

10
00:00:47,493 --> 00:00:48,685
tranexamic acid.

11
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:54,772
Gluconolactone and a fermented pomegranate enzyme complete the exfoliating blend.

12
00:00:55,472 --> 00:01:00,155
Together, they thoroughly exfoliate, help unclog pores, and reveal smoother,

13
00:01:00,155 --> 00:01:01,018
brighter skin.

14
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:06,070
It works at different layers of the skin's surface, so the exfoliation is thorough

15
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:08,597
while the peel stays easy to use at home.

16
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:14,478
The product page lists three benefits: it reduces the appearance of fine lines and

17
00:01:14,478 --> 00:01:19,598
wrinkles, evens skin tone for brighter skin, and minimizes the appearance of pores.

18
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:25,608
A lipid-rich blend with upcycled cranberry extract promotes long-lasting hydration.

19
00:01:26,308 --> 00:01:27,716
Here is how to use it.

20
00:01:27,716 --> 00:01:32,452
Start with dry, cleansed skin, and massage the peel evenly over your face.

21
00:01:33,152 --> 00:01:35,895
Leave it on for one to three minutes, then rinse.

22
00:01:35,895 --> 00:01:38,805
You may feel some tingling as the product activates.

23
00:01:39,505 --> 00:01:41,667
Begin by using it every other day.

24
00:01:41,667 --> 00:01:45,290
Notice how your skin responds, and build up to daily use.

25
00:01:45,290 --> 00:01:49,105
Starting slowly gives your skin time to adjust to the acids.

26
00:01:49,805 --> 00:01:53,622
If you use it during the day, follow with a moisturizer and SPF.

27
00:01:53,622 --> 00:01:55,352
And keep it out of your eyes.

28
00:01:56,052 --> 00:02:01,456
So, the Liquid Peelfoliant is an at-home peel with thirty percent acids and enzymes

29
00:02:01,456 --> 00:02:03,734
for dullness, fine lines and pores.

30
00:02:03,734 --> 00:02:07,836
Use it on dry, clean skin for one to three minutes, then rinse.

31
00:02:07,836 --> 00:02:09,854
The link is in the description.
